@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 38
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Developer" as Dev
participant "Trace UI" as UI
participant "Pull Request\nAnalysis" as PR
participant "Azure DevOps\nGit API" as ADO

Dev -> UI: Analyze pull request links
UI -> PR: Request PR dependency context
PR -> ADO: Read pull request relations
ADO --> PR: Linked work item references
PR --> UI: Structured PR relationship result
UI --> Dev: Display pull request dependency context
@enduml
